{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46888","headline":"和西蜀可准大师远寄之什 · 齐己","name":"和西蜀可准大师远寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫知何路去追攀，空想人间出世间。\n杜口已同居士室，传心休问祖师山。\n禅中不住方爲定，说处无生始是闲。\n珍重希音远相寄，乱峰西望叠孱颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}